---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro'; import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Contact sales" description="Discuss examination management, proctoring and customer-hosted deployment requirements with Smart Exam."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-title-only"><span class="eyebrow">Contact sales</span><h1>Start with the problem you need to solve.</h1><p class="intro">Discuss a program, a deployment requirement or an enterprise integration. We will identify the right next conversation.</p></div></section><section class="form-section"><div class="container form-layout"><aside class="form-aside"><h2>Connect the business and technical questions.</h2><p>Include your examination workflow, expected scope and the people who will evaluate the platform. Please use business information only.</p><div class="contact-options">{site.salesEmail && <a href={`mailto:${site.salesEmail}`}>{site.salesEmail}</a>}{site.telephone && <a href={`tel:${site.telephone}`}>{site.telephone}</a>}{site.whatsapp && <a href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsapp.replace(/\D/g, '')}`} rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Business</a>}{site.teamsBookingUrl && <a href={site.teamsBookingUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">Choose a Teams meeting time</a>}<a href="/request-demo/">Request a product demonstration</a><a href="/partners/">Discuss a partnership</a></div><p style="margin-top:25px;font-size:.8rem">Direct contact and meeting channels will appear here when the official commercial details are confirmed.</p></aside><LeadForm kind="contact" buttonLabel="Send a sales inquiry" /></div></section></Base>
